    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank Worldwide Governance Indicators (WGI) Government Effectiveness Score</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Government Effectiveness Score is one of the World Bank Worldwide Governance Indicators (WGI). It captures perceptions of the quality of public services, the quality of the civil service and the degree of its independence from political pressures, the quality of policy formulation and implementation, and the credibility of the governments commitment to such policies.</narrative>
    </description>
